Package: darling-lol-launcher
Version: @VERSION@
Section: contrib/otherosfs
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: darling-lol maintainers <@MAINTAINER@>
Homepage: https://github.com/QuinsZouls/darling-lol
Depends: darling-lol (= ${binary:Version}), python3 (>= 3.8)
Installed-Size: @LAUNCHER_INSTALLED_SIZE@
Description: per-user launcher for the darling-lol runtime
 Ships the unrendered templates under /usr/lib/darling-lol and the
 darling-lol(1) wrapper, which renders them into
 ~/.local/share/darling-lol for the invoking user (host home, guest
 user, guest home and SDK path are per-user, so they cannot be baked
 into a system package) and then starts the Riot client.
